Happy Easter from The Battle Cats! Time for an egg (cat) hunt!

Can YOU find the Eggy Cats in this picture? Pick out the real Eggy Cats from a pile of fakes and vote for the correct number by hitting LIKE on the answer in the comments below!

If total SHARES, LIKES, and VOTES for this post hit 2,500 on both Instagram and Facebook, then all players will get a special prize!

Plus, login to the Battle Cats from April 1st at 11am to take on special springtime challenges in Stories of Legend/Event Stages and try for limited edition Uber/Super Cats at the Rare Capsules!

Check out this post on Instagram at:<br>
https://www.instagram.com/p/BSWOFtQAkUl/

